    22  consent rules: minimum necessary, no misleading/coercing consent, SEPARATE consent for
        sensitive categories, guardian consent for under-14, no re-processing beyond consent,
        no repeated nagging after refusal, RE-CONSENT on any change of purpose/means/categories
    23  access/copy/correct/delete/restrict/account-cancellation/consent-withdrawal requests must
        be handled promptly with convenient channels; no unreasonable conditions may be imposed
    35-36  cross-border conditions list + treaty override
    37  important data leaving the country requires the CAC security assessment
